/*  A function returns a new object holding its parameter.
    Obligation broken: O1, what is read must not be deeper than the checker thinks. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Define object bag with (the series of number items).
Bind bag to make-bag, given (the series of number s):
    Return a new bag { the items s }.
Done.
Define keeper as a new bag { the items (a series of number) }.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    keeper becomes cast make-bag on (inner).
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State keeper's items.
